en translated by $5$ units down. Hence, $D=-5.$\n\nTherefore, $B+D=\\frac{3}{2}+(-5)=-\\frac{7}{2}.$\n\nFinally, the equation of the curve is\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{3x}{2})-5.\n$$" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250678 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250679 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250680 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250681 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250682 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1041 "selection" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250681 13194139533781 true] [17592186250677 1110 #uuid "9d05ad20-f842-564d-9b39-68acf66fba8a" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250678 1034 "\\frac{13}{2}" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250678 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533781 true] [17592186250678 1111 #uuid "5cd468a0-9b78-530a-a9b3-4d5d92a61124" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250679 1034 "-\\frac{17}{4}" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250679 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533781 true] [17592186250679 1111 #uuid "eec6d319-df77-5fee-a246-a68e8ccc6599" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250680 1034 "-\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250680 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533781 true] [17592186250680 1111 #uuid "04b8ff0c-3594-5f2b-9085-89943bf5318e" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250681 1034 "-\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250681 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533781 true] [17592186250681 1111 #uuid "f082efb1-4250-5c5e-b202-93cbc4bd2c1b" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250682 1034 "\\frac{23}{4}" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250682 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533781 true] [17592186250682 1111 #uuid "f6e73a94-f30c-5985-93e9-e5e8fece272d" 13194139533781 true] [17592186250683 1017 #edb/ref 17592186250684 13194139533781 true] [17592186250683 1089 "q-143670" 13194139533781 true] [17592